@RemsToRems_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5269

### Patient match (S1 John Smith; dateOfBirth is the UTC date)
POST {{RemsToRems_Api_HostAddress}}/registry/match
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "requestId": "3de6e667-9c77-4ec3-b18e-cdfcc19cae4c",
  "patient": {
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Smith",
    "dateOfBirth": "1979-12-31",
    "zipcode": "12345"
  }
}

### Validation error (expect 400 application/problem+json, codes 112, 108, 110)
POST {{RemsToRems_Api_HostAddress}}/registry/match
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "requestId": "3de6e667-9c77-4ec3-b18e-cdfcc19cae4c",
  "patient": {
    "firstName": "J0hn",
    "lastName": "Smith",
    "dateOfBirth": "01/01/1980",
    "zipcode": "1234"
  }
}
